# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo (checked out as-is; core.autocrlf
# is off). Prevents the CRLF/LF flip-flop that made a rebrand look like a
# whole-file rewrite. Git auto-detects text vs binary; the explicit markers
# below guard files git might otherwise misclassify.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
*.node binary
*.wasm binary
*.pak binary
*.bin binary
